# .wikiignore
# Patterns of paths under raw/ that the wiki engine will skip during
# corpus discovery, ingest, and lint citation checks.
#
# Syntax:
# - Lines starting with `#` are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
# - A pattern ending with `/` matches any directory component with that name
#   anywhere under raw/ (e.g. `OneNote_RecycleBin/` skips the whole tree).
# - All other patterns are fnmatch globs matched against the file name AND
#   against the path relative to raw/.

# OneNote artifacts that are not knowledge content
OneNote_RecycleBin/
Z_Old_Notes/

# Editor / sync junk
*Untitled*.md
~$*.md
.DS_Store
